OL,3,AFootage of Tibet floods isn't being
OL,4,Ashown in China - and we know little
OL,5,Aabout victims there
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe dramatic footage was almost
OL,8,Fimpossible to miss. A torrent of water
OL,9,Ftearing through Gyirong Port, one of
OL,10,Fthe main border crossings between Nepal
OL,11,Fand Tibet, sweeping away all in its
OL,12,Fpath as hundreds of people fled for
OL,13,Ftheir lives.
OL,15,FThe scenes, captured by CCTV cameras,
OL,16,Fquickly spread on social media and onto
OL,17,Fscreens around the world.
OL,19,FExcept here, in China.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/37
